      "comment": "BRINDLE SURPRISE (8) has a strong overall record having 14 wins and 22 places from 49 starts including a last start success (34.30) over 600m at this track. Form here is sound including four wins. Boxed wide but will go close with the right run. ASCEND GERANIUM (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (38.16) in a Mix 4/5 FIN at Bendigo. Solid record at the distance winning four races. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. ULENTA BALE (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.65) at this track behind Paw Quebec in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Must be included in calculations. VIKING RULER (5) missed the frame latest (30.08) when sixth over 515m at Sandown in a Grade 5 FIN. Has two wins already from this draw.",
